{
	"nodes":[
		{
			"id":"afd582d0000cba2b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Discover the first day date to be able to calculate the current day",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-640,
			"y":-200,
			"width":290,
			"height":100,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"d12bf52ae69e7b3b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Draft a [[030 - Drafting Studio.canvas|030 - Drafting Studio]] room and look at the calendar to look at the first day.\n\nDay 0 is the day previous to the first day.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-440,
			"y":0,
			"width":420,
			"height":160,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"0f82ae0171fb7169",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"\n\nDraft the [[027 - Library.canvas|027 - Library]] once and order a book and then draft the [[027 - Library.canvas|027 - Library]] on another day and read the book, taking notes of the day that the book was ordered on the slips at the other side of the book front cover.\n\nThe day the book was ordered minus the day count at the day you ordered = Day 0.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1000,
			"y":0,
			"width":500,
			"height":220,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"c9189bc5d77b739d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Draft the [[Shelter.canvas|Shelter]] on the [[Outer Room.canvas|Outer Room]]",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-625,
			"y":340,
			"width":260,
			"height":80,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"e785b4f3fde29c2e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Unlock the [[Outer Room.canvas|Outer Room]] permanent upgrade.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-635,
			"y":-320,
			"width":280,
			"height":80,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"81025ca107f41c8a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Access the shelter's terminal and set the safe to unlock one hour after the current date time.\n\nDay 0 = November 6th\nCurrent Day = November 6th + Days Passed\nTime = Current Hour + 1-2 hours",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-720,
			"y":480,
			"width":450,
			"height":180,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"ee0f8c6162b7e3e9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Rewards\n\n- [[Red Letters.canvas|Red Letter]] 7\n- One red gem",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-180,
			"y":280,
			"width":280,
			"height":200,
			"color":"4"
		}
	],
